								<Entry Name="Statusword" Index="#x6010" Sub="#x01">
									<Type>UINT</Type>
									<Comment><![CDATA[Bit 0 : Ready to switch on
Bit 1 : Switched on
Bit 2 : Operation enabled
Bit 3 : Fault
Bit 4 : reserved
Bit 5 : reserved
Bit 6 : Switch on disabled
Bit 7 : Warning
Bit 8 + 9 : reserved
Bit 10 : TxPDOToggle
Bit 11 : Internal limit active
